{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the foundation module ui becomes the workspace package @purin-labs/ui in foundation/ui. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder. sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from versionsFrom. edits: text edits of the files that name a root folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs, and of a path that is no import; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. package.exports: each .ts file is an entry (./*), a .tsx file that another module imports has an entry of its own, and the style sheets are entries (./*.css); the other .tsx files stay inner files behind index.ts, as in apps/portal/src/ui/. The tsconfig has the settings of the Portal and the types of vite/client, and the package passes a type check of its own.",
